      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so ive had this weird dull ache around my belly button all afternoon and now it feels like it moved a bit lower down to the right side. it's kinda annoying but not like i can't move or anything. i'm thinking it's just bad gas or something from lunch... can i just take some advil and sleep on it? i dont really want to go to the er if i dont have to",
