    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont have a fever or anything and it's not like a sharp stabbing pain, it's just a heavy feeling. i feel fine otherwise, just a bit uncomfortable. im pretty sure it's just indigestion. if i take a few extra advil and maybe some antacids, wouldn't that settle it down? i really don't want to deal with a hospital bill for just gas.",
