      "content": "Even without sharp pain or fever, shifting abdominal pain is a key symptom of appendicitis that often progresses rapidly. Relying on painkillers like Advil can actually mask these symptoms, making it harder for doctors to diagnose the issue correctly if you do need urgent care. It is far better to get assessed by a medical professional now to rule out serious conditions and avoid potentially expensive or life-threatening outcomes later. Please consider seeking medical advice immediately over home remedies.",
